l we will initiate the process of corporate action with NSDL/CDSL for crediting/debiting the shares in the respective demat account of the shareholders and then we will file an application for the Trading approval with the stock exchanges. Kindly take the same in your records. Note 2: Lalit S. Kanodia HUF - 2 and Yogendra Kanodia HUF were forming part of Promoter Group Category. Their holdings in the Company is NIL and this two HUFs are dissloved. Hence, we have removed their names from Promoter Group Category. Please take the same in your records.","revisedData":"N","revisedDate":null,"revisedRemark":null,"revisedStatus":"-","revisionDate":null,"revisionRemark":null,"shareholdingPatternNotes":null,"submissionDate":"19-APR-2024","symbol":"DATAMATICS","systemDate":"19-APR-2024 11:40:09","timeDifference":"00:04:16","typeOfSubmission":null,"underlyingDrs":null,"xbrl":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/SHP_187698_1099952_19042024113552_WEB.xml","xbrlFileSize":null},{"broadcastDate":"12-JAN-2024 16:08:38","cgTimeStamp":null,"countString":null,"date":"31-DEC-2023","desc":"NEW_1","employeeTrusts":"0","format":null,"index":"-","industry":"-","isin":"INE365B01017","name":"Datamatics Global Services Limited","newColumn":false,"pr_and_prgrp":"66.44","promoterDematNotes":null,"publicShareholdingNotes":null,"public_val":"33.56","recordId":"184008","remarksWeb":"N","revisedData":"N","revisedDate":null,"revisedRemark":null,"revisedStatus":"-","revisionDate":null,"revisionRemark":null,"shareholdingPatternNotes":null,"submissionDate":"12-JAN-2024","symbol":"DATAMATICS","systemDate":"12-JAN-2024 16:10:20","timeDifference":"00:01:42","typeOfSubmission":null,"underlyingDrs":null,"xbrl":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/SHP_184008_1018636_12012024040838_WEB.xml","xbrlFileSize":null},{"broadcastDate":"08-JAN-2024 14:59:30","cgTimeStamp":null,"countString":null,"date":"30-SEP-2023","desc":"NEW_1","employeeTrusts":"0","format":null,"index":"-","industry":"-","i