 group. Since Mr. Yogendra Kanodias shares were transmitted to Mrs. Rashmi Kanodia (wife of Late Yogendra Kanodia), Mrs. Rashmi Kanodia forms part of the person belonging to the promoter group w.e.f. January, 2023. Further as per regulation 31(A)(6)(c), in case of death of a promoter/ person belonging to the promoter group, such person shall automatically cease to be included as a promoter/ person belonging to the promoter group, so  Mr. Yogendra Kanodia will not  form part of the promoter group.    Further Mrs. Rashmi Kanodia was already holding 2730 shares and was categorized in Resident Individuals holding nominal share capital up to Rs. 2 lakhs, after transmission of 5870 shares of late Mr. Yogendra Kanodia, at present Mrs. Rashmi Kanodia is holding 8600 shares of the Company.","revisedData":"N","revisedDate":null,"revisedRemark":null,"revisedStatus":"-","revisionDate":null,"revisionRemark":null,"shareholdingPatternNotes":null,"submissionDate":"19-APR-2023","symbol":"DATAMATICS","systemDate":"19-APR-2023 17:30:12","timeDifference":"00:13:17","typeOfSubmission":null,"underlyingDrs":null,"xbrl":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/SHP_177476_826242_19042023051654_WEB.xml","xbrlFileSize":null},{"broadcastDate":"16-JAN-2023 12:10:07","cgTimeStamp":null,"countString":null,"date":"31-DEC-2022","desc":"NEW_1","employeeTrusts":"0","format":null,"index":"-","industry":"-","isin":"INE365B01017","name":"Datamatics Global Services Limited","newColumn":false,"pr_and_prgrp":"70.91","promoterDematNotes":null,"publicShareholdingNotes":null,"public_val":"29.09","recordId":"174296","remarksWeb":"Mr. Yogendra Surajmal Kanodia person forming part of promoter group expired on April 30, 2022. Mr. Yogendra Surajmal Kanodia (Karta of Yogendra Kanodia HUF) part of promoter group expired on April 30, 2022.","revisedData":"N","revisedDate":null,"revisedRemark":null,"revisedStatus":"-","revisionDate":null,"revisionRemark":null,"shareholdingPatternNotes":null,"submissionDate":"1